<BaseLayout title="Troubleshooting" description="Quick fixes for common LS Genesis Coupe swap problems.">
  <h1>Troubleshooting</h1>
  <p>Common problems from real builds, and where the fix lives.</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Symptom</th><th>Likely fix</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Running hot</td><td>3.8 upgraded radiator + shroud, push/pull fans, oil cooler, Corvette spacing on BK1 — <a href="/guides/cooling">Cooling</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Hot spots, temps creep, cooling system won't bleed</td><td>Steam vent line missing or routed wrong; run it to just below the radiator cap — <a href="/guides/cooling#steam">Cooling</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Melted wiring / burning smell near fuse box</td><td>Header too close to the fuse box or harness; add clearance and shielding — <a href="/guides/exhaust">Exhaust</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Can't get DBW pedal to work with Holley</td><td>Needs a 6-pin pedal + Terminator X Max with the right harness — <a href="/guides/gas-pedal#which">Gas Pedal</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Fans come on at key-on</td><td>Disable key-on fan operation in Holley — <a href="/guides/cooling#key-on">Cooling</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Wild intake air temp readings</td><td>IAT in hot radiator air; relocate to the back of the intake — <a href="/guides/cooling#iat">Cooling</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Battery not charging</td><td>Alternator needs a resistor-equipped trigger; set Holley input to digital frequency — <a href="/guides/alternator">Alternator</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Won't crank with push to start</td><td>Ground the starter relay, then use the pink wire — <a href="/guides/wiring#push-to-start">Wiring</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Holley drops out while cranking</td><td>Feed ECU power from the driver's fuse box ECU slot — <a href="/guides/wiring#holley-power">Wiring</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Fuel tank building pressure</td><td>Vent the EVAP line to atmosphere — <a href="/guides/fuel-system#evap">Fuel System</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Power steering leaks / heavy steering</td><td>Use the correct adapter and a pressure reducer; Pentosin CHF 202 — <a href="/guides/power-steering">Power Steering</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Odometer stopped after ABS delete</td><td>Keep the ABS module plugged in — <a href="/guides/brakes">Brakes &amp; ABS</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>No speedo on Holley dash</td><td>Wire the VSS to J4 or update to V3 software — <a href="/guides/ecu#speedo">ECUs &amp; Tuning</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>No reverse lights</td><td>Reverse switch pigtail and relay wiring — <a href="/guides/wiring#auto-reverse">Wiring</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Cabin / pedal area too hot</td><td>DEI tunnel shielding plus exhaust wrap — <a href="/guides/exhaust#heat">Heat Shielding</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Broken axles</td><td>Sedan -LAM axles to ~600 hp; Ford 8.8 IRS beyond — <a href="/guides/differential">Differential &amp; Axles</a></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

